        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "COMING SOON: Elm Place, Dublin 6 – A New Standard of Living in Milltown\r\n \r\nElm Place is an exclusive new collection of beautifully designed one- and two-bedroom apartments in the heart of Milltown, Dublin 6. This luxury development is being delivered by O’Flynn Group, one of Ireland’s most respected residential developers. Renowned for building exceptionally high-quality homes, O’Flynn Group brings a long-standing commitment to craftsmanship, thoughtful design and lasting quality to this distinctive new address.\r\n \r\nPerfectly positioned on Milltown Road, Elm Place places residents within easy reach of Ranelagh, Donnybrook, Ballsbridge, UCD and Dublin city centre. The nearby Milltown and Cowper Luas Green Line services provide fast and convenient connections across the city, while established bus routes, cycle links and local road networks make every journey straightforward, whether travelling for work, study or leisure.\r\n \r\nEveryday essentials and lifestyle amenities are close at hand. Milltown, Ranelagh and the surrounding neighbourhoods offer an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, shops and services, together with parks, sports clubs, schools and recreational facilities. From a morning coffee and daily shopping to dining out, fitness and weekend walks, Elm Place is designed around the convenience of having so much on your doorstep.\r\n \r\nEach A-rated apartment at Elm Place will offer excellent energy efficiency alongside bright, well-considered interiors and generous private balconies. Beautiful contemporary bespoke kitchens and top-of-the-range interior fixtures and fittings, guided by No.10 Design, will create homes of exceptional style, comfort and quality. Attractive landscaped surroundings will complement the apartments, while residents will benefit from an on-site gym, resident’s lounge & work spaces, private basement parking for selected homes, secure bicycle parking and the convenience of a car club on site.\r\n \r\nElm Place brings together a sought-after Dublin 6 address, excellent connectivity and an outstanding range of local amenities, creating a welcoming new place to call home for those who value quality, convenience and effortless city living.\r\n \r\nRegister your interest now for further information and priority updates."
